<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    Leaf component: HTML readability extraction + HTML-to-Markdown conversion.
    (组件化交付规程 S1；对应「浏览器 mode=text / http_fetch 正文」两条通道共用同一套抽取)

    Boundary rules, asserted by ComponentBoundaryTests (S4):
      * ZERO <ProjectReference> — nothing may be depended upon.
        Two independent consumers point at this project and it points at neither:
          - PuddingRuntime        (http_fetch: HTML → Markdown body)
          - PuddingBrowser.AgentTools (browser_snapshot mode=text)
        Neither currently references the other, so reusing one from the other would
        create a reverse dependency; a shared leaf is the only direction that compiles
        cleanly.
      * <PackageReference> is limited to the parsing libraries themselves. No logging,
        no DI, no host abstractions — otherwise the leaf drags the host in again.
  -->

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="HtmlAgilityPack" Version="1.12.4" />
    <PackageReference Include="ReverseMarkdown" Version="5.3.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="PuddingHtmlTests" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
